# This repository tracks PIPELINE SOURCE ONLY.
#
# Run outputs, download caches, candidate shortlists, TNS report packages and
# outreach correspondence stay local and are never committed. The strategy is
# deny-by-default: everything is ignored, and source files are re-included
# explicitly below. Adding a new run-output directory therefore requires no
# .gitignore change -- it is ignored automatically.

# 1. Ignore everything.
*

# 2. Re-include pipeline source.
!*.py
!requirements.txt

# 3. Re-include documentation.
!*.md

# 4. Re-include this file.
!.gitignore

# 5. Explicit exclusions from the rules above.
#    Empty placeholder, no implementation yet -- drop this line to publish it.
comet_candidate_hunter.py
#    Scratch trigonometry notes, unrelated to the pipeline.
Untitled-1
